          "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\nOmitted. Hint: In one direction one uses the functor\n<MATH_0001>\nand in the other the functor\n<MATH_0002> where the subscript\nindicates we take the degree <MATH_0003> part.\n<STRUCT_0002>",
